ion set wall construction in progress"}, {"src": "./images/conan-anniv-fabrication-workshop-building-the-exhibition-letsuan-design.jpg", "alt": "Fabrication workshop building the exhibition set walls"}, {"src": "./images/conan-anniv-le-tsuan-design-workshop-panel-fabrication-letsuan-design.jpg", "alt": "Le Tsuan Design workshop panel fabrication"}];
